      {
        "id": 224070,
        "name": "Missingno",
        "username": "Missingno",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-08T20:19:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint at 14/15/16/15/14, though I can't say I wasn't worried.&nbsp; I noticed at the start that visonary had her coccon in hand so I just threw that out and had her tank the zombie hoard because I sure didn't want to mess with that!&nbsp; Argent and Chrono flailed around a bit trying to get setup while doing chip damage to Gloomy one way or another (I grabbed the dart thrower at the first oppertunity) and only got setup in the final moments.&nbsp; The real star was Idealist who just freaking wrecked everything, especially since she got the tiara, robot, knives, and monster out at great times.&nbsp; The knifes were used a bit more than the robot since visonary was on tank duty and I often wanted to hit more than just gloomy, though once the zombies were buried and visonary was out Twist the Eather went right onto Idealist for extreme karate robot action!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>...Oh yeah, DW Nightmist was there and was as usless as she usally is in that varient.</p>",
