      {
        "id": 224073,
        "name": "Missingno",
        "username": "Missingno",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/missingno/{size}/2049_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-09T00:01:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trumpet of Doom\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Trumpet of Doom:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mint, 9/3/6/6/6. Visionary spent most of the game Cocooned, and I never played Twist the Ether - for CR, I pulled out The Masadah (and then spent about half the game waiting for bounties).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is why I pulled out the dart thrower first, I didn’t want to gamble on a bad hand and settled for steady chip damage with decreasing Gloomy’s power…though it turns out it wasn’t nessisary since Gloomy never did the attack.</p>",
