      {
        "id": 224074,
        "name": "gossamerica2",
        "username": "gossamerica2",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/51bf81/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-13T04:47:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Gloomy is my favorite punching bag, so I've played this a few times.&nbsp; In all cases, it can be dicey until Positive Energy Field comes out, after which life gets better.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>First game, I played Twist the Ether on Chrono-Ranger, and had Nightmist help him dig for bounties.&nbsp; Also manipulated the environment deck to keep PEV out longer.&nbsp; Arget Adept eventually managed to get some good stuff out.&nbsp; Finished with everybody at 17 or 18.</p>\n<p>Second game, I played TTE on Idealist.&nbsp; Final HPs ranged from 11-18.</p>\n<p>Third game, I put Visionary in her cocoon to tank and ignored zombies.&nbsp; Finished at 15-18 HP.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
